      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaalagira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gano n'amateeka agagema ku kutukuzibwa kw'omuntu awonie endwaire ey'ebigenge. Ku lunaku lw'aja okulangirirwaku ati mulongoofu, anaaleetebwanga eri kabona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.8.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 8:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.1.44"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 1:44",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.5.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 5:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabona oyo anaavanga mu kifo aghali weema edh'abantu abatali balwaire, yaaja yaamwekebeedha. Endwaire bw'enaabanga ng'ewonie, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabona oyo aidha kulagiranga okuleeta enhonhi ibiri enamu era enongoofu, n'omuti oguwunha akawoowo, n'oluwuuzi olw'olugoye olw'erangi ya kasaayisaayi, n'akati akeetebwa hissopu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kabona aidha kulagiranga okwitira eyindi ku nhonhi edho, mu kibya eky'eitosi omuli amaadhi agaviire mu nsulo edhikuuluula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aidha kutoolanga enhonhi esigairegho enamu ghalala n'omuti gule oguwunha akawoowo, n'oluwuuzi lule olw'olugoye lw'erangi ya kasaayisaayi, n'akati kale akeetebwa hissopu, byonabyona yaabiinhika mu musaayi gw'enhoni eitiibwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aidha kumansiranga omusaayi ogwo emikuzi musanvu ku oyo aja okutukuzibwaku endwaire eyo ey'ebigenge, memale yaamulangirira ati mulongoofu. Era anaalekulanga enhonhi enamu eyo, yaaja ng'egulukira mu ibbanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu oyo aja okutukuzibwa anaayozanga ebivaalo bye, yaamwaku enviiri dhoonadhoona, yaanaaba, olwo yaabalibwa nga mulongoofu, memale yaaja eri weema edh'abatali balwaire. Aye anaamalanga enaku musanvu ng'ali ku luya lwa weema ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwomusanvu kabiri anaamwangaku enviiri dhoonadhoona, n'ekirevu, n'ebisige, n'obuviiri bwonabwona ku mubiri. Era anaayozanga ebivaalo bye, yaanaaba omubiri, olwo yaabalibwa nga mulongoofu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ku lunaku olwomunaana anaaleetanga entaama ento enume ibiri, n'entaama enduusi ndala ey'omwaka omulala, dhoonadhoona nga dhiziraku kikyamu kyonakyona. Era anaaleetanga kilo isatu edh'obuwunga bw'engaano obuseereibwa obukalamu, nga butabwirwamu omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva. Era yaaleeta ekitundu kirala kirala ku buli bitundu bisatu ebya lita ey'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabona aidha kutwalanga omuntu oyo n'ebintu ebyo emberi w'Eweema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kabona anaatoolanga eyindi ku ntaama edho enume ento, ghalala n'ekitundu kirala kirala ku buli bitundu bisatu ebya lita ey'omuzigo ogw'emiti emyoliva, yaabighaayo ng'omutango, yaabiwuuba, bibe ekigheebwayo nga kiwuubibwa mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho anaitiranga entaama eyo ento mu kifo ekitukuvu aghaitirwa ensolo dhe baghaayo ng'ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi, n'edho dhe baghaayo ng'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa. Anaakolanga atyo, kuba ekigheebwayo ng'omutango kiba kya kabona ng'oti n'ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi bwe kiba, era kitukuvu inho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kabona anaatoolanga ku musaayi ogw'ekigheebwayo ng'omutango, yaagusiiga ku ntobo ya kutu ow'oku mukono omusaadha, ni ku kyala ekisaadha, ni ku kigere ekisaadha eky'oku mugulu omusaadha, ogw'oyo aja okulangirirwa ng'omulongoofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabona anaatoolanga ku muzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva, yaagufuka mu ngalo dhe dheene edh'oku mukono omugooda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yainhika olwala lwe olw'oku mukono omusaadha mu muzigo ogwo oguli mu ngalo dhe edh'oku mugooda, yaagumansira emikuzi musanvu agho mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaatoolanga ku muzigo ogunaabanga nga gusigairegho mu ngalo dhe, ni ku musaayi ogw'ekigheebwayo ng'omutango, yaagusiiga ku ntobo ya kutu ow'oku mukono omusaadha, ni ku kyala ekisaadha eky'oku mukono omusaadha, ni ku kigere ekisaadha eky'oku mugulu omusaadha, ogw'oyo aja okulangirirwa nga mulongoofu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuzigo ogunaabanga nga gusigaire mu ngalo dhe, anaagusiiganga ku mutwe gw'oyo aja okulangirirwa nga mulongoofu. Agho kabona oyo anaaghangayo omusengo olw'okutukuza omuntu oyo, mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kabona anaaghangayo ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi, ng'omusengo olw'oyo aja okutoolebwaku obutali bulongoofu. Ekyo nga kiwoire, anaitanga ensolo ey'ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaakighaayo ku alutaari ghalala n'ekigheebwayo eky'emere ey'empeke. Mu nsambo eyo kabona anaaghangayo omusengo olw'omuntu oyo, era omuntu oyo yaaba mulongoofu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aye bw'anaabanga omwavu atasobola kufuna byaga agho, anaaleetanga entaama ento enume, ebe ekigheebwayo ng'omutango. Enaabanga ekigheebwayo eri Musengwa Katonda nga kiwuubibwa, ekiba ekya kabona. Anaaleetanga kilo ndala ey'obuwunga obw'engaano, obutabwirwamu omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva, era yaaleeta ekitundu kirala kirala ku buli bitundu bisatu ebya lita ey'omuzigo ogw'ebibala eby'emiti emyoliva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era aidha kuleetanga enjiibwa ibiri, oba amaghemba amato abiri nga bw'anaabanga ng'aghanze. Eighemba erindi linaabanga ekigheebwayo olw'ebibi, n'erindi ekigheebwayo ekyokebwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olwomunaana anaabireetanga eri kabona olw'okutukuzibwa kwe mu maiso ga Musengwa Katonda, ku mulyango gw'Eweema ey'Okwagaananirangamu ni Musengwa Katonda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
